# 🌿 Nature Creatures Website

A beginner-friendly HTML5 and CSS project built while learning frontend web development.

## 📖 About the Project

This project is a simple webpage about nature and wildlife. It helped me practice the fundamentals of HTML5, semantic elements, CSS styling, and Chrome Developer Tools.

> **Note:** This project is currently a work in progress; certain sections and styling are still being refined.

## 🚀 Features

- Semantic HTML5 structure
- Fixed header
- Navigation menu
- Hero banner with image
- Article section
- Image gallery
- Join section with form
- Footer
- External CSS styling

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Google Chrome Developer Tools

