## 🎯 Learning Outcome

Through this project, I learned how to:

- Build webpages using semantic HTML5 elements.
- Create layouts using CSS positioning.
- Design a fixed header.
- Work with images and navigation bars.
- Create simple forms.
- Use Chrome Developer Tools for inspecting and testing webpage designs.
- Understand the difference between temporary browser changes and permanent source code changes.

